msgid "Row"
msgstr "列"

msgid "Value"
msgstr "數值"

msgid "The requested digit must be between 1 - 9."
msgstr "要求檢驗的位數必須介於 1 - 9 之間。"

msgid "The requested digit must be between 10 - 99."
msgstr "要求檢驗的位數必須介於 10 - 99 之間。"

msgid ""
"Displayed values are rounded to the number of decimals set in the global "
"preferences."
msgstr "顯示的數值會四捨五入至全域偏好設定中所設定的小數位數。"

msgid "Observed vs. Expected Relative Frequencies"
msgstr "觀察到的相對次數與期望相對次數"

msgid ""
"<b>Figure %1$i.</b> The observed relative frequencies of each digit in the "
"data set compared to the expected relative frequencies under %2$s. For data "
"sets distributed according %2$s the blue dots will lie near the top of the "
"grey bars."
msgstr "<b>圖 %1$i。</b> 資料集中各數字的觀察相對次數，與 %2$s 下的期望相對次數之比較。對於依 %2$s 分布的資料集，藍點將位於灰色條形的頂端附近。"

msgid "Bayes Factor Robustness Plot"
msgstr "貝氏因子穩健性圖"

msgid ""
"<b>Figure %1$i.</b> The results of a robustness check using the Bayes "
"factor. The figure illustrates the impact of different specifications (i.e., "
"concentration parameters) of the Dirichlet prior on the Bayes factor values, "
"providing insights into the robustness of the statistical evidence to the "
"choice of prior distribution."
msgstr "<b>圖 %1$i。</b> 使用貝氏因子進行穩健性檢核的結果。此圖說明 Dirichlet 先驗的不同規格（即集中參數）對貝氏因子值的影響，提供統計證據對先驗分布選擇之穩健性的洞見。"

msgid "Sequential Analysis Plot"
msgstr "序列分析圖"

msgid ""
"<b>Figure %1$i.</b> The results of a sequential analysis using the Bayes "
"factor. The figure provides insight into how the statistical evidence from "
"these data accumulates over time and under different prior specifications."
msgstr "<b>圖 %1$i。</b> 使用貝氏因子進行序列分析的結果。此圖呈現隨時間推移以及在各種先驗規格下，來自這些資料的統計證據如何累積。"

msgid "<u>Conclusion</u>"
msgstr "<u>結論</u>"

