msgid ""
"The goal of this procedure is to determine to what extent the predictions of "
"an algorithm are fair towards protected groups on a sensitive attribute, and "
"to test this fairness with a type-I error of %1$s%%. Considering the "
"positive class (<i>%2$s</i>), fairness -or discrimination- can be quantified "
"using so-called fairness measures. Calculating a fairness measure involves "
"determining the value of the model evaluation metric on which the fairness "
"measure is based for both the privileged (<i>%3$s</i>) and unprivileged "
"groups.\n"
"\n"
"In this specific case, equalized odds is not based on a single model "
"evaluation metric but rather on two: the true positive rate and the false "
"positive rate. Therefore, using equalized odds requires applying two "
"statistical tests to check for any significant differences between the "
"values that the two model evaluation metrics take for each of the two "
"groups. The two tests conducted are Pearson's chi-squared tests. Only if the "
"null hypothesis is rejected for both tests can we conclude that the "
"algorithm is fair."
msgstr "此程序的目標在於判定演算法之預測在敏感屬性上對於受保護群體是否公平，並以類型一誤差率 %1$s%% 檢驗此公平性。考量陽性類別 (<i>%2$s</i>)，公平性（或歧視性）可使用所謂的公平性指標加以量化。計算公平性指標涉及同時判定受優惠 (<i>%3$s</i>) 與未受優惠兩組在作為公平性指標基礎之模型評估指標上的數值。\n\n在此特定案例中，均衡機率並非基於單一的模型評估指標，而是基於兩個：真陽性率與假陽性率。因此，使用均衡機率需要套用兩次統計檢定，以檢查此兩種模型評估指標在兩組間所取數值是否存在顯著差異。所進行的兩次檢定為皮爾森卡方檢定。唯有當兩次檢定的虛無假設都被拒絕時，才能推論該演算法是公平的。"

msgid ""
"The goal of this procedure is to determine to what extent the predictions of "
"an algorithm are fair towards protected groups on a sensitive attribute, and "
"to test this fairness with a type-I error of %1$s%%. Considering the "
"positive class (<i>%2$s</i>), fairness -or discrimination- can be quantified "
"using so-called fairness measures. Calculating a fairness measure implies "
"determining the value of the model evaluation metric, on which the fairness "
"measure is based, for both the privileged (<i>%3$s</i>) and unprivileged "
"groups. Subsequently, a statistical test is conducted to check for any "
"significant differences between the values that the model evaluation metric "
"takes for each of the two groups. The used test is the Pearson's chi-squared "
"test."
msgstr "此程序的目標在於判定演算法之預測在敏感屬性上對於受保護群體是否公平，並以類型一誤差率 %1$s%% 檢驗此公平性。考量陽性類別 (<i>%2$s</i>)，公平性（或歧視性）可使用所謂的公平性指標加以量化。計算公平性指標涉及判定受優惠 (<i>%3$s</i>) 與未受優惠兩組在作為公平性指標基礎之模型評估指標上的數值。隨後進行統計檢定，以檢查此模型評估指標在兩組間所取數值是否存在顯著差異。所使用的檢定為皮爾森卡方檢定。"

msgid "<u>Assessing Model Fairness</u>"
msgstr "<u>評估模型公平性</u>"

