msgstr "平權"

msgid "p"
msgstr "p"

msgid ""
"The null hypothesis specifies that the %1$s of an unprivileged group is "
"equal to that of the privileged (P) group."
msgstr "虛無假設指定未受優惠群體的 %1$s 等於受優惠 (P) 群體之值。"

msgid ""
"The null hypothesis specifies that the %1$s of an unprivileged group is "
"greater than, or equal to, that of the privileged (P) group."
msgstr "虛無假設指定未受優惠群體的 %1$s 高於或等於受優惠 (P) 群體之值。"

msgid ""
"The null hypothesis specifies that the %1$s of an unprivileged group is "
"lower than, or equal to, that of the privileged (P) group."
msgstr "虛無假設指定未受優惠群體的 %1$s 低於或等於受優惠 (P) 群體之值。"

msgid ""
