msgid ""
"True Positives (TP) are cells in which the positive class (<i>%1$s</i>) is "
"correctly predicted, while True Negatives (TN) are cells where the negative "
"class is correctly predicted. False Negatives (FN) are cells in which the "
"positive class is incorrectly predicted, and False Positives (FP) are cells "
"in which the negative class is incorrectly predicted."
msgstr "真陽性 (TP) 是正確實地被預測為陽性類別 (<i>%1$s</i>) 的格子，而真陰性 (TN) 是負類別被正確預測的格子。假陰性 (FN) 是陽性類別被不正確預測的格子，假陽性 (FP) 是負類別被不正確預測的格子。"

msgid "Parity Estimates Plot"
msgstr "平權估計圖"

msgid ""
"<b>Figure %1$i.</b> Estimated parity statistics (i.e., the ratio of %2$s "
"from each unprivileged group to the privileged %3$s group) for all groups in "
"the data. The closer the parity lies to one, the less discrimination occurs "
"in the algorithm."
msgstr "<b>圖 %1$i。</b> 資料中所有群體之估計平權統計量（即各未受優惠群體相對於受優惠 %3$s 群體之 %2$s 比率）。平權愈接近一，表示演算法中發生的歧視愈少。"

msgid "<u>Parity Estimates Plots</u>"
msgstr "<u>平權估計圖</u>"

msgid "Parity Estimates Plot - True Positive Rate Parity"
msgstr "平權估計圖 - 真陽性率平權"

